  title: Cave Monsters
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9a4bc43d77ee2c458d60b542251ea2e, type: 3}
  description: '<b>Cave Monsters</b>


    Cave Monsters are indigenous creatures
    that inhabit the underground caves of this planet.


    They naturally consume
    minerals, but for some reason they have also developed a strange interest in
    artificial materials such as gears and screws.


    Although they are not very
    intelligent, they are still dangerous. Most Cave Monsters repeatedly patrol the
    same path and only move when you move.


    If their path is blocked, they will
    simply change direction and continue patrolling.


    Be careful when moving
    near them. A Cave Monster will attack if you end your movement adjacent to it.'
  isImageBig: 0
